title: Sync Splash Screen - 75th Anniversary Animation
raw_community_title: Enable 75th Anniversary Splash Screen
category: Sync and Infotainment
platform: F-150
model_years: 2021-2026
trim: All
validated: true
verified_by: Kyle / AsBuiltPro
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: 'Requires Sync ver 22012 or higher - reset APIM in FORScan after either/both
  changes. other screen available

  No target setting provided in As Built Pro

  Other options available such as 03 for Raptor, 04 for Black Label, 05 for Presidential,
  1A for Dark Horse animation, etc.'
prerequisites: Sync ver 22012 or higher - reset APIM in FORScan after either/both
  changes
post_procedure: Reset APIM in FORScan or cycle ignition.
steps:
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-03-01
  mask: xxxx **xx xx--
  notes: Requires Sync ver 22012 or higher - reset APIM in FORScan after either/both
    changes
  feature_name: Splash Screen (SS)
